\section rosapi ROS API

List of nodes:
- \b underwater_vehicle_sim_node
- \b clock_server_node


<hr>

\subsection underwater_vehicle_sim_node underwater_vehicle_sim_node

underwater_vehicle_sim_node models and simulates autonomous underwater vehicles

\subsubsection Usage
\verbatim
$ underwater_vehicle_sim_node
\endverbatim

\par Example

\verbatim
$ underwater_vehicle_sim_node
\endverbatim


\subsubsection topics ROS topics

Subscribes to:
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/<4dof_prop_module_name>/command_velocity" : [geometry_msgs/Twist] Commands for the vehicle propulsion module
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/atBase": [std_msgs/Bool] Determines if the vehicle is at the base station
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/charging": [std_msgs/Bool] Determines if the vehicle is charging at the base station
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/transferring": [std_msgs/Bool] Determines if the vehicle is transferring data at the base station

Publishes to:
- \b "/clock_server/speed_up_factor": [std_msgs/Float64] Updates the rate of the simulated clock
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/atBase": [std_msgs/Bool] Determines if the vehicle is at the base station
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/<module_name>/data" : [underwater_vehicle_sim/VehicleData] Data collected by the vehicle
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/power" : [std_msgs/Float64] Broadcasts the current charge of the vehicle
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/dataCapacity" : [std_msgs/Float64] Broadcasts the current data capacity of the vehicle

\subsubsection parameters ROS parameters

Reads the following parameters from the parameter server

- \b "underwater_vehicle_sim/hertz" : \b [float] specifies the update rate of the simulation
- \b "model_type" : \b [string] Defines the type of model used in the simulation
- \b "speed_up_factor" : \b [float] Defines the default rate for the simulated clock
- \b "/base_x" : \b [float] Defines the x location of the base station
- \b "/base_y" : \b [float] Defines the y location of the base station
- \b "/base_z" : \b [float] Defines the z location of the base station
- \b "/base_range" : \b [float] Defines the range of the base to be considered at it
- \b "/vehicles/names" : \b [string array] Defines the vehicle names
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/start_x" : \b [float] Defines the starting x location of the vehicle
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/start_y" : \b [float] Defines the starting y location of the vehicle
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/start_z" : \b [float] Defines the starting z location of the vehicle
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/start_power" : \b [float] Defines the starting power of the vehicle
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/start_dataCapacity" : \b [float] Defines the starting data capacity of the vehicle
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/propModuleName" : \b [string] Defines the name of the propulsion module for the vehicle
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/moduleNames" : \b [string array] Defines the name of the general modules for the vehicle
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/<module_name>/hertz" : \b [float] Update rate of specified module
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/<module_name>/type" : \b [string] type of specified module
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/start_dataCapacity" : \b [float] Defines the starting data capacity of the vehicle
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/<4dof_prop_module_name>/max_linear_velocity" : \b [float] Max linear velocity for propulsion module
- \b "/vehicles/<name>/<4dof_prop_module_name>/max_rotate_velocity" : \b [float] Max rotational velocity for propulsion module
- \b "/charge_rate" : \b [float] Sets the charge rate of all vehicles
- \b "/max_charge" : \b [float] Sets the max charge of all vehicles
- \b "/transfer_rate" : \b [float] Sets the data transfer rate of all vehicles
- \b "/max_data" : \b [float] Sets the max data capacity of all vehicles

\subsubsection services ROS services
- \b "/vehicles/get_info": [underwater_vehicle_sim/GetVehicleInfo] Returns information on the vehicles in the simulation


<!-- END: copy for each node -->

<hr>

\subsection clock_server_node clock_server_node

clock_server_node publishes the simulated clock signal

\subsubsection Usage
\verbatim
$ clock_server_node
\endverbatim

\par Example

\verbatim
$ clock_server_node
\endverbatim


\subsubsection topics ROS topics

Subscribes to:
- \b "/clock_server/speed_up_factor": [std_msgs/Float64] Updates the rate of the simulated clock

Publishes to:
- \b "/clock": [rosgraph_msgs/Clock] Updates the simulated clock

\subsubsection parameters ROS parameters

Reads the following parameters from the parameter server

- \b "/speed_up_factor" : \b [float] Sets the default speed up factor for the clock
- \b "/sim_start_time" : \b [float] Sets the start time of the simulation

